     "<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\"><div><div>What do you you mean the random init code and the model</div><div>tougher?  You just argued above to keep them separated.</div><div><br></div><div>I think it would be possible to implement that extra block —</div><div>we’d just need to create another var_context that takes</div><div>in a model instance.</div></div></div>"
    ]
