     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div>This is something I think would be really useful in practice.  Complex models can have trouble converging from completely random inits but often have good data-based initializations  (eg, for a GPLVM, initializating the latent space with PCA or, for timeseries models, initializing with temporally smooth trajectories).</div><div><br></div><div>Cheers,</div><div>Marcus</div><div><br></div></div></div>\r\n"
